WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.055 --> 00:00:04.711
"Where am I?" Roxy muttered as she stood in the middle of a dirt road.

2
00:00:04.712 --> 00:00:08.064
"How did I get here?" She looked around.

3
00:00:08.065 --> 00:00:13.019
"And where's Sun Wukong? He was right in front of me a second ago!"

4
00:00:13.020 --> 00:00:18.774
As Roxy explored her new surroundings, she realized she was still up in the mountains.

5
00:00:18.775 --> 00:00:25.911
But below there was nothing but dark wilderness. Metro City had disappeared too.

6
00:00:25.912 --> 00:00:29.396
*** Meanwhile, farther up the road, two demons were

7
00:00:29.397 --> 00:00:33.524
walking. "I'm relieved that Master got his mountain back," the tall demon said.

8
00:00:33.525 --> 00:00:37.514
The short demon nodded. "I'm looking forward to the feast.

9
00:00:37.515 --> 00:00:40.755
We'll finally eat the Tang Monk, and then we'll . . . "

10
00:00:40.756 --> 00:00:46.264
"Live forever!" both demons said at once, chuckling.

11
00:00:46.265 --> 00:00:50.876
The tall demon's stomach rumbled. "I wish we could eat right—"

12
00:00:50.877 --> 00:00:57.982
The short demon held up a hand to silence him. "Shh! I hear someone."

13
00:00:57.983 --> 00:01:02.767
The two demons hid behind a boulder as a young girl walked by.

14
00:01:02.768 --> 00:01:07.181
"She's wearing such strange clothes," the short demon said.

15
00:01:07.182 --> 00:01:09.701
"She's not from around here."

16
00:01:09.702 --> 00:01:14.188
"Let's eat her!" the tall demon said greedily.

17
00:01:14.189 --> 00:01:19.630
"Wait," the short demon whispered. "Someone else is coming!"

18
00:01:19.631 --> 00:01:22.062
*** Roxy heard voices approaching

19
00:01:22.063 --> 00:01:26.270
too. Suddenly several tough-looking men walked toward her, out of the

20
00:01:26.271 --> 00:01:31.462
dark. "Hi!" Roxy called, waving to the men. "Can you please tell me where I

21
00:01:31.463 --> 00:01:35.433
am?" One man stepped forward, gripping a heavy wooden

22
00:01:35.434 --> 00:01:38.969
club. "Give us all your money," he

23
00:01:38.970 --> 00:01:43.336
yelled. Roxy rolled her eyes and shot back, "You don't scare

24
00:01:43.337 --> 00:01:45.724
me!" The man stomped toward

25
00:01:45.725 --> 00:01:51.501
Roxy. Whiz-hoo! Roxy fired her eye laser beams, and the wooden club instantly burst into flames.

26
00:01:51.502 --> 00:01:53.104
"Ahh!"

27
00:01:53.105 --> 00:01:55.524
Roxy laughed as the man released the club.

28
00:01:55.525 --> 00:02:03.342
The other men looked frightened. "She's a spirit—let's run!"

29
00:02:03.343 --> 00:02:07.331
*** "Did you see that?" the short demon whispered to the tall

30
00:02:07.332 --> 00:02:11.590
one. The tall demon nodded. "She has amazing magic

31
00:02:11.591 --> 00:02:15.126
powers. Do you think she's the goddess Swift Wing told our master

32
00:02:15.127 --> 00:02:18.647
about?" "She must be," the short demon

33
00:02:18.648 --> 00:02:23.497
replied. Roxy walked along the road. "This is bad," she

34
00:02:23.498 --> 00:02:28.563
thought. "It's dark and I have no idea where I am. I need to get

35
00:02:28.564 --> 00:02:31.811
home." Just then an old man and woman came

36
00:02:31.812 --> 00:02:36.222
along. "Hello, child, are you lost?" the man

37
00:02:36.223 --> 00:02:40.243
asked. Roxy looked at the couple for a moment, wondering if she could trust

38
00:02:40.244 --> 00:02:42.647
them. She decided they looked

39
00:02:42.648 --> 00:02:46.238
friendly. "Yes, I'm lost," Roxy

40
00:02:46.239 --> 00:02:49.938
admitted. "You look tired," the woman

41
00:02:49.939 --> 00:02:54.324
said. "We work for a wealthy squire who's quite

42
00:02:54.325 --> 00:03:01.886
kind. Why don't you come with us? The squire will let you stay at his house

43
00:03:01.887 --> 00:03:06.545
tonight." Roxy followed the couple to a big, beautiful house on the mountain.

44
00:03:06.546 --> 00:03:09.669
The man brought Roxy a plate of warm food.

45
00:03:09.670 --> 00:03:18.659
Then the woman showed her to a cozy bedroom, where Roxy quickly fell asleep.

46
00:03:18.660 --> 00:03:22.497
The next morning Roxy had tea with the squire.

47
00:03:22.498 --> 00:03:27.673
"You don't live around here, do you?" the squire asked.

48
00:03:27.674 --> 00:03:29.798
Roxy shook her head.

49
00:03:29.799 --> 00:03:31.751
The squire leaned closer.

50
00:03:31.752 --> 00:03:36.050
"Do you come from . . . another world?"

51
00:03:36.051 --> 00:03:41.581
Roxy shrugged. "I guess so. My home is a lot different from this place."

52
00:03:41.582 --> 00:03:49.354
The squire smiled. "You have amazing powers."

